@startuml UC-04
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-04.md
title UC-04: Refresh Token
footer Feature AUTH-04 | Business rules: BR-03, BR-04
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer / Staff / Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "AuthController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "AuthService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
participant "ITokenService" as TOK <<Daisy.Infrastructure>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Open a page that needs the API
MVC -> API : Call API with expired access token
API --> MVC : 401 Unauthorized
MVC -> API : POST /api/auth/refresh { refreshToken }
API -> SVC : RefreshAsync(refreshToken)
SVC -> DB : Find user by RefreshToken
alt token not found or RefreshTokenExpiresAt passed
  SVC --> API : UnauthorizedException
  API --> MVC : 401 Unauthorized
  MVC -> MVC : Delete auth cookie
  MVC --> U : Redirect to login page
else Status = Locked (BR-03)
  SVC -> DB : Clear RefreshToken\nSaveChangesAsync
  SVC --> API : UnauthorizedException
  API --> MVC : 401 Unauthorized
  MVC -> MVC : Delete auth cookie
  MVC --> U : Redirect to login page
else valid
  SVC -> TOK : CreateAccessToken(user)
  SVC -> TOK : CreateRefreshToken()
  TOK --> SVC : new tokens
  SVC -> DB : Replace RefreshToken + expiry\nSaveChangesAsync (BR-04)
  SVC --> API : AuthResult
  API --> MVC : 200 OK { accessToken, refreshToken }
  MVC -> MVC : Update auth cookie
  MVC -> API : Retry original request
  API --> MVC : Response
  MVC --> U : Show page
end

@enduml
